Indrajit leaves fight enters city and exits west gate --- Indrajit sets illusory Sītā on chariot to delude hosts --- Hanumān leads rock bearing monkeys and sees wretched Sītā --- Indrajit seizes Sītā hair and strikes her amid Rāma cries --- Tearful Hanumān rebukes woman killing and threatens doom --- Rākṣasa ranks check charging monkey ranks --- Indrajit justifies harming foes and swords illusory Sītā --- Hanumān hears triumph roar as despairing monkeys flee